# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every OS.
# Without this, git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks files out with CRLF. The husky hooks
# then fail ("/usr/bin/env: 'sh\r': No such file or directory") and `npm run format:check`
# reports every file, because Prettier expects LF. `text=auto` leaves binary files alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
